<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#091411">
    <title>Lobby | Preguntones</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link href="/web2-unlam-tp-final/estilos/aplicacion.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="lobby-page">

    {{> components/headerView}}

    <main class="page-content">

        <section class="panel lobby-hero" aria-labelledby="lobby-heading">
            <div class="level-ring" style="--xp: {{xp_porcentaje}}" role="img" aria-label="Nivel {{nivel}}, {{xp_porcentaje}}% hacia el siguiente nivel">
                <div class="level-ring-inner">
                    <span class="level-ring-label">Nivel</span>
                    <span class="level-ring-value">{{nivel}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lobby-hero-body">
                <p class="eyebrow mb-0">Lobby del invocador</p>
                <h1 id="lobby-heading" class="page-title">Bienvenido, {{usuario}}</h1>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <span class="rank-badge">{{rango}}</span>
                    <span>{{xp_actual}} / {{xp_siguiente_nivel}} XP para el nivel siguiente</span>
                </div>
                <div class="xp-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span style="width: {{xp_porcentaje}}%"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lobby-hero-action">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-accent px-4" disabled>Jugar partida</button>
                <small>Disponible próximamente</small>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="lobby-grid">

            <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="stats-heading">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2 id="stats-heading">Estadísticas</h2>
                    <span class="live-label">Temporada actual</span>
                </div>

                {{#estadisticas}}
                    <dl class="stat-grid">
                        <div class="stat-tile">
                            <dt>Partidas jugadas</dt>
                            <dd>{{partidas_jugadas}}</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-tile">
                            <dt>Precisión</dt>
                            <dd>{{precision}}%</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-tile">
                            <dt>Mejor racha</dt>
                            <dd>{{mejor_racha}}</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-tile">
                            <dt>Puntaje total</dt>
                            <dd class="player-score">{{puntaje_total}}</dd>
                        </div>
                    </dl>
                {{/estadisticas}}

                <div class="category-list">
                    <h3>Precisión por categoría</h3>
                    {{#categorias}}
                        <div class="category-row">
                            <span class="category-name">{{nombre}}</span>
                            <div class="category-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                                <span style="width: {{precision}}%"></span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="category-value">{{precision}}%</span>
                        </div>
                    {{/categorias}}
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="ranking-heading">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2 id="ranking-heading">Ranking</h2>
                    <a href="{{ranking_show_url}}" class="panel-link">Ver completo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>

                <ol class="mini-ranking">
                    {{#ranking}}
                        <li class="{{#usuario_actual}}current-player{{/usuario_actual}}">
                            <span class="position">{{posicion}}</span>
                            <span class="player-name">
                                {{usuario}}
                                {{#usuario_actual}}<span class="you-badge">Vos</span>{{/usuario_actual}}
                            </span>
                            <span class="player-score">{{puntaje}}</span>
                        </li>
                    {{/ranking}}
                </ol>
            </section>

            <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="partidas-heading">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2 id="partidas-heading">Últimas partidas</h2>
                    <span class="live-label">Últimas 5</span>
                </div>

                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table ranking-table align-middle">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th scope="col">Resultado</th>
                                <th scope="col">Categoría</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Aciertos</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Puntaje</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {{#ultimas_partidas}}
                                <tr>
                                    <td>
                                        {{#victoria}}<span class="result-badge result-win">Victoria</span>{{/victoria}}
                                        {{^victoria}}<span class="result-badge result-loss">Derrota</span>{{/victoria}}
                                        <span class="match-date">{{fecha}}</span>
                                    </td>
                                    <td>{{categoria}}</td>
                                    <td class="text-end">{{aciertos}}/{{total}}</td>
                                    <td class="text-end player-score">+{{puntaje}}</td>
                                </tr>
                            {{/ultimas_partidas}}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel locked-panel {{#crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}is-locked{{/crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}" aria-labelledby="crear-heading">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2 id="crear-heading">Crear nueva pregunta</h2>
                    {{#crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}<span class="lock-badge">Bloqueado</span>{{/crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}
                </div>

                <div class="locked-body">
                    <div class="aside-icon lock-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"></rect>
                            <path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <p>Proponé tus propias preguntas sobre League of Legends para que las respondan otros invocadores.</p>

                    {{#crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}
                        <p class="lock-note">
                            Se desbloquea en el <strong>nivel {{nivel_requerido_crear_pregunta}}</strong>.
                            Te faltan {{niveles_faltantes}} niveles.
                        </p>
                        <div class="unlock-progress">
                            <div class="xp-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                                <span style="width: {{progreso_desbloqueo}}%"></span>
                            </div>
                            <span>Nivel {{nivel}} / {{nivel_requerido_crear_pregunta}}</span>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-accent w-100" disabled>Crear pregunta</button>
                    {{/crear_pregunta_bloqueada}}
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>

        {{> components/footerView}}
    </main>
</body>
</html>
